================================================================================
Bundled third-party assets
================================================================================

Fonts shipped inside the application bundle and on the project website
(apps/desktop/public/fonts/, 16 .woff2 subsets, ~148 KB total). Both families
are self-hosted rather than loaded from a CDN, so that the application makes no
network request at startup — see apps/desktop/src/styles/fonts.css.

  Onest
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    https://github.com/oleg-lab/onest

  IBM Plex Mono
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Copyright 2017 IBM Corp.
    https://github.com/IBM/plex

Subsetting procedure and the full file inventory are documented in
apps/desktop/public/fonts/README.md.

================================================================================
Models downloaded at runtime
================================================================================

Wotold does not bundle machine-learning models: they are downloaded on demand
from Hugging Face on first use and stored in the user's application data
directory (see restriction R10 in docs/ПАСПОРТ_ПРОЕКТА.md). They are therefore
NOT distributed as part of this Work, and their licenses are not granted by the
Apache License above. Each model carries its own upstream terms.

The authoritative catalog — including download URL, SHA256, size, and a
license_url for every entry — lives in:

  apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/local_engine/model_catalog.rs

Upstream sources currently referenced by that catalog:

  Speech recognition      ggerganov/whisper.cpp (GGML Whisper builds)
  Summarization / chat    bartowski/Qwen2.5-*-Instruct-GGUF
  Diarization             csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0
  Voice activity          ggml-org/whisper-vad (Silero VAD)
  Embeddings              intfloat/multilingual-e5-small

Users are responsible for reviewing the terms of any model they choose to
download.

================================================================================
Vendored design prototype
================================================================================

docs/design/wotold-v2/_reference/ contains a frozen browser prototype of the
Wotold v2 interface, authored for this project. It loads React and Babel from a
CDN when opened directly from the filesystem; it is a design reference only and
is not part of any shipped artifact.

